@startuml
!include includes/style.puml
allow_mixing

title 一个模块长什么样（vertical slice）
caption 新功能 = 新模块目录 + 注册一行；其他模块只依赖 public contracts/services。

package "modules/<name>/" as Mod {
  component "api.py\nHTTP / tool entry" as API <<service>>
  component "contracts.py\nDTO + public interface" as Contracts <<infra>>
  component "services.py\napplication service" as Services <<service>>
  component "domain.py\npure logic" as Domain <<service>>
  component "models.py\nown tables" as Models <<infra>>
  component "events.py\nin-process events" as Events <<infra>>
}

component "composition root\nmain.py / registry" as Root <<infra>>
component "其他模块" as Other <<service>>

Root --> API : register
API --> Services
Services --> Domain
Services --> Models
Services --> Contracts
Services --> Events
Other --> Contracts : 只依赖 public
Other -[#B91C1C,dashed]-> Models : 禁止 import

note bottom of API
  **模块自己的入口**
  core: DRF router；ai: FastAPI router / tool；
  只做参数校验和调用 services。
end note

note bottom of Contracts
  **public 边界**
  只放 DTO / 接口；
  不暴露 ORM 对象。
end note

note bottom of Mod
  **每个模块都要有**
  README.md（职责/表/事件/依赖）
  tests/（单元 + 模块集成）
  migrations/（core）
end note

@enduml
